            <ArticleTitle>[Analysis of diagnostic efficiency of lung ventilation parameters in patients with bronchial asthma].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>19-22</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The goal of this work was to perform probabilistic assessment of the diagnostic efficiency of lung ventilation parameters in patients with bronchial asthma. The efficiency of the suggested method was compared with that of the widely used technique of contrast of means. Study was performed in 365 patients with bronchial asthma and 216 apparently healthy subjects. Structural analysis of the diagnostic efficiency of lung ventilation parameters was performed on the basis of pooled and separate estimates. The results of the study made it possible to classify the lung ventilation parameters according to the degree of their diagnostic validity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
